# Require maintainer review on infra / security-sensitive paths.
# GitHub's `pull_request` event already does NOT run workflow files that a PR
# modifies (built-in protection), so CI-editing PRs can't auto-trigger from the
# PR context. CODEOWNERS adds the mandatory review gate on top (enforced via
# branch protection). Owner identity from package.json author UID 1711810.
.github/        @taraxvoid
/.husky/        @taraxvoid
/package.json   @taraxvoid
/bun.lock       @taraxvoid
/scripts/       @taraxvoid
/CLAUDE.md      @taraxvoid
